            </staffGrp>
          </scoreDef>
          <section xml:id="m-9d804497-72e3-4cfe-b6c3-8f095c378090">
            <pb xml:id="m-1a0e7a56-d589-458e-a828-f0d31e3b9441" n="651" facs="#m-2bb4aa96-921a-42aa-9d41-a518599a2705" />
            <staff xml:id="m-0c089cbb-d26c-4c37-bce7-212d9e4fbb45" n="1">
              <layer xml:id="m-bf735342-793c-49c6-aaa2-254d55b93fa5" n="1">
                <sb xml:id="m-e1499729-0800-49f5-95f4-646a6d06fe55" n="1" facs="#m-221322d1-0d06-4f86-9479-3dd2b4d1ee34" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <staff xml:id="m-06ca7a66-3a8b-4518-b391-cce7c24deb15" n="2">
              <layer xml:id="m-06367931-a2ae-4fa7-8112-c9de4761c6e1" n="1">
                <sb xml:id="m-3eedc155-7009-4f7d-b445-683be892638e" n="2" facs="#m-ba44aff9-a6ef-4115-be25-d3a7aa111749" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-ed04595c-1c74-495f-8545-e27f3faffe4c">
              <lg xml:id="m-0e1318e1-df04-4c60-a24f-0ed3af7f1b8c">
                <l xml:id="m-27dbe783-7055-4101-b193-07d7de0b21dc" facs="#m-ceadb7ed-9756-4080-aea4-d5177dc75a45" label="ambiguous">505</l><l xml:id="m-45582398-1644-4469-88b6-3542f56c10a1" facs="#m-72cba540-de85-4aa5-99f5-f09142ca1f06" label="text-like">Sexagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-d69d2e22-14ef-4999-9873-84cfc43c38da" facs="#m-85d63ac4-87b9-4a3f-b2a8-274ec6761ea0" label="lyrics-like">nos. Ps. Dé-us, áuribus nóstris audí¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8e40bf5-3cef-4c2d-8a1e-e50fb95e3452" facs="#m-065d5971-68f0-4350-add1-57b6941c8d14" label="ambiguous">nos, et li-be-ra</l><l xml:id="m-9f3eefd3-f28f-4774-a14a-c1c52baa0a4b" facs="#m-5af0b911-7646-4cc7-8ee1-e6e2e743a0c4" label="lyrics-like">vimus: * pâtres nóstri annunti-a-vérunt nó- bis. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-daedf68d-2e2e-4e9a-8884-b591c3cf5fd9" facs="#m-dfd80e9d-8fcb-416d-9330-6cc742bac2de" label="lyrics-like">Pátri. Eu ou a e. (Kyrie XI, p. 46).</l><l xml:id="m-9f6fd241-7000-4192-bdb0-121f0e697cae" facs="#m-a8c84fff-c384-4c03-880d-8f554c618d32" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-231ad48a-4ac0-42b7-8a19-1f37586534f1" facs="#m-1d3e335a-f7a2-4522-8375-a0d3c69c276e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui cónspicis quia ex nulla vérsa ómnia,“Doctóris géntium</l><l xml:id="m-c77212c7-1647-4ef3-bfdb-24d2a07fe2ee" facs="#m-308f298d-e294-40b2-86fc-38f7ceb0c9bd" label="lyrics-like">Unostra actióne confidimus: t protectióne muniámur. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-61c352e3-e310-45cd-b05c-2c111a4d9434" facs="#m-a03713ab-3798-433c-acb5-f69d20a89135" label="lyrics-like">concéde propitius; ut contra ad-l num.</l><l xml:id="m-f8f80659-9fce-4164-b7e5-3c77f7285564" facs="#m-1da854ca-d3ae-41c1-b866-2ef21ed22b4d" label="text-like">Second Collect. A cunctis. D. 498. Third at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-a2ec88ec-77ad-4342-bf05-f9e7fd0e82bd" facs="#m-1243a820-27ce-4708-864f-41fd7a8f6dc6" label="text-like">Before the Purification, second and third Collects. Secrets and Post¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef9a0d4b-2d32-4a4c-b838-d90e39a59f97" facs="#m-326b9120-36ba-4036-9d36-b5d8a19dba59" label="text-like">communions as indicated on pp. 498, 501-502 for Septuagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-66c65022-e062-4780-92d4-3fb285921765" facs="#m-59b5ceaf-a3fb-4c2f-a815-7634ffc2f78f" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 2. Cor.I</l><l xml:id="m-e1dc8fbc-ef3d-4ee8-baba-4b0b977a43a6" facs="#m-7e0073ee-f6be-4445-94ae-0b629f76327d" label="lyrics-like">LVRatres : Libénter suffértis insi-lin labóre et aerúmna, in vigiliis</l><l xml:id="m-cbfe80f8-1542-4fb8-8afc-362c63364a2b" facs="#m-0f00bab5-f807-4112-af56-903a0a07a93c" label="lyrics-like">piéntes: cum sitis ipsi sapién¬</l><l xml:id="m-3300e6d1-2da5-4e1a-a935-66a08e171b13" facs="#m-1e9a289e-6ebd-45e5-b007-00bffd36199d" label="lyrics-like">multis, in fame et siti, in jejúniis</l><l xml:id="m-0b8fe64f-8bee-490a-bab5-f2d3a58bd08b" facs="#m-6a49d202-0df2-4835-8d20-9ba2318bfa95" label="lyrics-like">multis, in frigore et nuditáté : prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-18611803-8d6e-4fcf-a953-82bf58102eef" facs="#m-ded6ec57-4fcb-4d75-80f2-14fb87688427" label="lyrics-like">tes. Sustinétis enim si quis vos in</l><l xml:id="m-48a32135-ce3f-4d3a-97a1-e90e892109e4" facs="#m-3d5ed40c-4af7-4dd6-9506-75f82090dd17" label="lyrics-like">servitútem rédigit, si quis dévorat,</l><l xml:id="m-e3254ff2-c75f-453c-8a3a-9f842d98c2e2" facs="#m-144d285e-5042-4c6f-91f9-2c108f1f2c43" label="ambiguous">ter illa quae extrinsecus sunt, in¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a1062de-faba-4b5e-a82e-1145cf4f9b4c" facs="#m-0e5cb8bb-0059-4a85-b684-942666ba8bf6" label="lyrics-like">si quis áccipit, si quis extóllitur, si</l><l xml:id="m-980f6294-aba8-41e3-b34e-c68f80c63e5a" facs="#m-0091cca7-d6c9-4f19-ad7b-9e26cbef0651" label="lyrics-like">stántia mea quotidiána, sollicitúdo</l><l xml:id="m-46ba7319-8bff-4c74-902c-56e2ec5afb59" facs="#m-28966224-1294-493a-82c4-8ce815107685" label="lyrics-like">quis in fáciem vos caedit. Secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-43c98d05-4ebe-4eaf-a1af-a44c5c37a346" facs="#m-a51ad859-3e98-4fc0-a241-8d9fb2bff0fd" label="lyrics-like">ómnium ecclesiárum. Quis infirmá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba4901af-ac23-44ec-8b98-27c9515d04ec" facs="#m-4e9a5957-178d-444d-b353-f1c09ee28957" label="lyrics-like">ignobilitátem dico, quasi nos infir¬</l><l xml:id="m-d137a0af-17f7-46e2-a671-211fe60df831" facs="#m-7675973e-ca7c-449d-b954-a11529febc06" label="lyrics-like">tur, et ego non infírmor? quis scan¬</l><l xml:id="m-8e18a8eb-de50-4029-abf8-3af0443416c5" facs="#m-45168397-1b44-4669-a28a-70b5a11114a1" label="lyrics-like">mi fuérimus in hac parte. In quo</l><l xml:id="m-699d992c-20e6-4810-a5af-3361582054dc" facs="#m-dc2460e3-b1db-4ae9-abb9-3c1ba09a167d" label="lyrics-like">dalizátur, et ego non uror? Sigloriá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4aec0f02-c753-455b-9331-44903c010eb4" facs="#m-a3a5b548-d7f1-4973-8f53-2ea0a8c36472" label="lyrics-like">quis audet (in insipiéntia dico) au¬</l><l xml:id="m-dca928f7-a378-48bc-8901-0a63b7112df1" facs="#m-21c11f54-aadf-46c8-9621-a24ecd162125" label="lyrics-like">ri opórtet: quae infirmitátis meae</l><l xml:id="m-519b6eff-5b2e-463e-86e8-9da9dd1df50c" facs="#m-06a98949-1252-4f55-b12d-4a73191fcfa3" label="lyrics-like">sunt, gloriãbor. Deus et Pater</l><l xml:id="m-c32a8a3a-73c7-4f77-a680-0c1f5a882fbb" facs="#m-443fd65b-93a9-40cb-b6f9-a754065354d9" label="lyrics-like">deo et ego : Hebraéi sunt, et égo:</l><l xml:id="m-e4823181-04e0-4a3e-8a89-e370cc9f4fd8" facs="#m-d736a0dc-2b8e-4e03-b416-67b1524646ed" label="lyrics-like">Dómini nostri Jesu Christi, qui est</l><l xml:id="m-5165ff3f-042d-4707-8625-e6525b2ba538" facs="#m-09b71a86-6179-4113-8a49-3def452e463c" label="ambiguous">Israelitae sunt, et ego: Semen</l><l xml:id="m-a52a3e54-5311-459c-aeab-a3c694e21c01" facs="#m-2873fbaf-3bae-432c-bb69-11b38890edd3" label="lyrics-like">Abrahae sunt, et ego: Minístri</l><l xml:id="m-05d5bfb6-3616-4562-a6ea-bb2ad7bcb4aa" facs="#m-675a7b72-1dad-44bb-afaa-a31c7e93edbd" label="lyrics-like">benedíctus in saécula, scit quod non</l><l xml:id="m-5283d04c-64e0-421e-9be9-b3c5271063e6" facs="#m-6ea5688a-74c9-43fc-8407-5807badd93fd" label="lyrics-like">méntior. Damásci praepósitus gen¬</l><l xml:id="m-dabd103d-7b5d-4645-9f10-705fbe4c8d94" facs="#m-8c8581ef-204b-42a0-92a9-4e416986dae6" label="lyrics-like">Christi sunt, (ut minus sápiens dico)</l><l xml:id="m-1cd974f5-ae01-460a-a8bd-fe4a0e1ad729" facs="#m-6dd39384-d91f-464a-8f41-95e83e190a62" label="lyrics-like">plus ego: in labóribus plúrimis, in</l><l xml:id="m-554189aa-404d-4253-8364-f19bca8f66da" facs="#m-abb5b7a6-e72b-4998-bf8c-5bc4fcd6e83f" label="lyrics-like">tis Arétae regis custodiébat civitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e2d57f2-189f-4887-8848-a1fb101a4b7e" facs="#m-4d37c506-fc81-43ad-8b7d-d9174f58ff3b" label="lyrics-like">tem Damascenórum, ut me com¬</l><l xml:id="m-d13055ad-fdec-43ab-b78b-a0ee40ebcdfe" facs="#m-5686fef0-889b-4e41-9f2e-150bf25167a2" label="lyrics-like">carcéribus abundántius, in plagis</l><l xml:id="m-64abe441-b753-4437-8e48-dad838427f31" facs="#m-4475fd7d-2895-48a1-a0e9-ba732178140c" label="lyrics-like">supra modum, in mórtibus frequén¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf9e0f1f-d2a2-49b1-b883-2c27563cc091" facs="#m-a3aea23f-3a28-45bd-b435-5bb55f2ca6f3" label="lyrics-like">prehénderet: et per fenéstram in</l><l xml:id="m-635b9acd-3566-4d61-9125-eb49095c70ea" facs="#m-df57fb26-8a93-4ec7-86b0-a1b404aa01eb" label="lyrics-like">ter. A Judaéis quinquies quadragé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac435c89-3901-4d0f-87c7-e05b34e241f6" facs="#m-3cc6f899-5447-44bd-b2bc-3975dccb2947" label="lyrics-like">sporta dimíssus sum per murum, et</l><l xml:id="m-945c39af-b862-480e-a92c-9ea8a443f738" facs="#m-c2f6b601-2cfa-440e-a9d5-813790c58db9" label="lyrics-like">nas, una minus, accépi. Ter virgis</l><l xml:id="m-9102e59c-deeb-4005-a2ff-14e5c9e45d78" facs="#m-678fda9d-24ad-4201-bc29-5d471474de7a" label="lyrics-like">sic effúgi manus ejus. Si gloriári</l><l xml:id="m-faf8c7d6-242e-4c67-9210-c8f6571ce646" facs="#m-61cd2ded-da2d-4610-a560-d1d785fc3699" label="lyrics-like">caesus sum, semel lapidátus sum,</l><l xml:id="m-993ff5a9-f5dc-494f-b598-c055049bf479" facs="#m-b4dc8b5f-4801-4b8d-9f54-6afeb5a14d4e" label="lyrics-like">opórtet (non éxpedit quidem :) vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d2baa37-dad3-4937-a84f-06ee06d778ea" facs="#m-e38163bc-328d-4609-ba5d-322eed81e7cb" label="lyrics-like">ter naufrágium feci, nocte et die</l><l xml:id="m-4ba53888-43f6-4ace-af25-8064097da67a" facs="#m-076dbd65-85c5-4fb8-b1af-a444ac53ad32" label="lyrics-like">niam autem ad visiónes, et revela¬</l><l xml:id="m-20dcc86d-5fe6-48a0-817e-76e1a94e35d0" facs="#m-4a7c6757-b342-4042-9923-a8d83956d9fe" label="lyrics-like">in profúndo maris fui : in itinéribus</l><l xml:id="m-4fea5b7d-25a0-49e3-aa82-97d8d8d2e19a" facs="#m-f44dd48c-4511-4fae-b590-5e14cdbcbd2c" label="lyrics-like">tiónes Dómini. Scio hóminem in</l><l xml:id="m-b6c97e25-0664-4b12-a0b1-34c6d2a1d9ee" facs="#m-3db713c7-0b82-43b1-93b6-fa6b592f6207" label="lyrics-like">saëpe, periculis flúminum, periculis</l><l xml:id="m-dc743add-53b8-463e-8574-2f4e0eedd056" facs="#m-8e08af68-4714-446e-8883-3475d8993391" label="lyrics-like">Christo ante annos quatuórdecim,</l><l xml:id="m-f7eebb23-a2da-476b-a4ec-316ac71afd55" facs="#m-db1bd1fd-c543-447d-b85e-934a4c9653c5" label="lyrics-like">sive in córpore néscio, sive extra</l><l xml:id="m-d4ee39fb-b2cf-4ee7-83c1-aa0b28d01d4e" facs="#m-75d1cbba-0fa8-41e7-ad09-24890dd5290d" label="lyrics-like">latrónum, periculis ex génere, peri¬</l><l xml:id="m-933d99b4-b195-437e-98c3-f9d6d5cde156" facs="#m-ab5d2c91-994f-47a4-80c3-324109bf9978" label="lyrics-like">culis ex géntibus, persculis in civi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6090e45a-0db2-474e-a391-96011e35b3d8" facs="#m-5c0fc26b-a134-4723-8694-ce2f8f1d9d3b" label="lyrics-like">corpus néscio, Deus scit, raptum</l><l xml:id="m-f00f3405-897d-4097-aafb-8f8434891163" facs="#m-7a4a0b64-45ed-4d67-8b68-2efe818ea5aa" label="lyrics-like">táte, persculis in solitúdine, periculis</l><l xml:id="m-36883560-b424-47ee-8bd8-444eb7c6f0df" facs="#m-1abdacf2-72ad-4aba-9589-51b44de9cf78" label="lyrics-like">huiüsmodi usque ad tértium caelum.</l><l xml:id="m-107f4876-3399-4412-9685-eebae9832759" facs="#m-51964ce3-7566-4f0e-ae65-661d1cfd3ec9" label="lyrics-like">in mari, periculis in falsis frátribus:! Et scio hujúsmodi hóminem, sive</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>